{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow — NIETE registration v5.1 (bd-x7aprz.9, 2026-10-19). Same screens as v5; only the completion changed. Endpoint-driven (data_api_version 3.0, POST /api/flows/registration). `version` is Meta's Flow JSON schema version, not this asset's revision.",
  "_notes": [
    "WHY v5.1: v5's final reply asked the client to RENDER SUCCESS and the client never did (production 2026-10-19, four Finish taps, no nfm_reply, no welcome). The endpoint now closes the Flow itself: its TEACHING reply is {screen:'SUCCESS', data:{extension_message_response:{params:{registration_action, flow_token, full_name, language, school_linked}}}} — the contract v4 completed on. WhatsApp closes the Flow on that reply and sends the params as the nfm_reply.",
    "SUCCESS DECLARES extension_message_response.properties.params with each param named (whatsapp-flows rule 14: an undeclared sub-object is stripped). The heading, body and Done stay, shaped like v4's SUCCESS (no Form), for the case where the screen is ever shown; Done completes with registration_action so the chat ack still recognises it.",
    "v5 (registration-flow-v5.json) is kept as the superseded record of what was published 2026-10-16/19.",
    "SHORT FORM: no Country (always PK) and no Organization (the deployment's own, only where the row has none) — the endpoint sets both. No free-text school name and no EMIS field that saves an unmatched code: the school is CHOSEN from the schools table.",
    "SCHOOL SEARCH: ROLE_SCHOOL takes one search box (name, area or EMIS); the endpoint searches the 446 real schools (school-search.service.js) and SCHOOL_PICK lists up to ten plus 'My school isn't here' (id none). Searching again is the client's own back arrow: routing_model must stay forward-only (whatsapp-flows rule 7), so there is no backward route.",
    "ROLES: Teacher / Principal only (registration-roles.js FORM_ROLES). An admin-set coach/AEO is not asked — the radio is hidden by visible=${data.show_role} — and the endpoint never writes over her role.",
    "FIRST SCREEN IS BILINGUAL AND STATIC: she has not told us her language yet. Every later screen's words come from the endpoint in the language she picked (ux-strings regForm* keys); the caps are pinned per language by tests/registration/bd-x7aprz2-flow-v5-json.test.js.",
    "The underscore keys are documentation; bot/scripts/setup/meta-api.js strips them before upload."
  ],
  "version": "7.0",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "PERSONAL_INFO": [
      "ROLE_SCHOOL"
    ],
    "ROLE_SCHOOL": [
      "SCHOOL_PICK"
    ],
    "SCHOOL_PICK": [
      "TEACHING"
    ],
    "TEACHING": [
      "SUCCESS"
    ],
    "SUCCESS": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "PERSONAL_INFO",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "languages": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "ur",
              "title": "اردو"
            },
            {
              "id": "en",
              "title": "English"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_language": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "ur"
        },
        "init_full_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Ayesha Siddiqa"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "personal_form",
            "init-values": {
              "full_name": "${data.init_full_name}",
              "language": "${data.init_language}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Welcome to NIETE"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "Tell us a little about you. It takes about a minute.\nاپنے بارے میں تھوڑا سا بتائیں۔ ایک منٹ لگے گا۔"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "full_name",
                "label": "Name / نام",
                "input-type": "text",
                "required": true,
                "helper-text": "Your full name · آپ کا پورا نام"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "language",
                "label": "Language / زبان",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.languages}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Next / آگے",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "full_name": "${form.full_name}",
                    "language": "${form.language}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ROLE_SCHOOL",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your role and school"
        },
        "t_role_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your role"
        },
        "t_search_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "School name or EMIS"
        },
        "t_search_help": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "e.g. IMSG G-9/1, a village name or the EMIS code"
        },
        "t_search": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Search"
        },
        "roles": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "teacher",
              "title": "Teacher"
            },
            {
              "id": "principal",
              "title": "Principal / Head Teacher"
            }
          ]
        },
        "show_role": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": true
        },
        "init_role": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "teacher"
        },
        "init_query": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "IMSG G-9/1"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "role_school_form",
            "init-values": {
              "role": "${data.init_role}",
              "school_query": "${data.init_query}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "role",
                "label": "${data.t_role_label}",
                "required": false,
                "visible": "${data.show_role}",
                "data-source": "${data.roles}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "school_query",
                "label": "${data.t_search_label}",
                "input-type": "text",
                "required": true,
                "helper-text": "${data.t_search_help}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_search}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "role": "${form.role}",
                    "school_query": "${form.school_query}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SCHOOL_PICK",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Pick your school"
        },
        "t_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Schools matching “G-9/1”. Not in the list? Go back and search again, or choose “My school isn’t here”."
        },
        "t_pick_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your school"
        },
        "t_next": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Next"
        },
        "schools": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2",
              "title": "IMSG G-9/1",
              "description": "IMSG(I-X) G-9/1 · Urban-II · EMIS 424"
            },
            {
              "id": "none",
              "title": "My school isn’t here"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_school": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "a1b2"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "school_pick_form",
            "init-values": {
              "school_id": "${data.init_school}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.t_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "school_id",
                "label": "${data.t_pick_label}",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.schools}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_next}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "school_id": "${form.school_id}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "TEACHING",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your grades and subjects"
        },
        "t_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Pick all that apply. No class of your own? Leave these empty."
        },
        "t_grades": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grades"
        },
        "t_subjects": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Subjects"
        },
        "t_finish": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Finish"
        },
        "grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "grade_1",
              "title": "Grade 1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "subjects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "maths",
              "title": "Mathematics"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "__example__": [
            "grade_1"
          ]
        },
        "init_subjects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "__example__": [
            "maths"
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "teaching_form",
            "init-values": {
              "grade": "${data.init_grades}",
              "subjects": "${data.init_subjects}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.t_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "grade",
                "label": "${data.t_grades}",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.grades}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "subjects",
                "label": "${data.t_subjects}",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.subjects}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_finish}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "grade": "${form.grade}",
                    "subjects": "${form.subjects}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SUCCESS",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "terminal": true,
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "You’re registered"
        },
        "welcome_message": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Welcome, Ayesha! Tap Done and I’ll send your NIETE portal link in the chat."
        },
        "t_done": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Done"
        },
        "extension_message_response": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "params": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "registration_action": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "flow_token": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "full_name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "language": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "school_linked": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": {
            "params": {
              "registration_action": "complete",
              "flow_token": "uuid:registration:1760000000000",
              "full_name": "Ayesha Siddiqa",
              "language": "ur",
              "school_linked": "yes"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TextHeading",
            "text": "${data.t_heading}"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "${data.welcome_message}"
          },
          {
            "type": "Footer",
            "label": "${data.t_done}",
            "on-click-action": {
              "name": "complete",
              "payload": {
                "registration_action": "complete"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
